<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0569_T23R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ilex Forest BIG. Be careful!\rI went in for a hour and came\nout three days later. No\fsignal. No snacks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0569_T23R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The forest got a protector\nwatchin’.\rNo funny business in there. It\nsaw what I did in ’03.</language>
	</row>
</body>
